WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.631
Doctor, this is neXgen Healthcare —

00:00:03.631 --> 00:00:11.759
the simplest way to fill your OPD with confirmed patients, while every rupee of your consultation fee stays with you.

00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:16.564
Today, most clinics run on crowds and guesswork.

00:00:16.564 --> 00:00:25.218
Patients queue from early morning, some never turn up, and many who searched for a doctor like you simply never found you.

00:00:26.618 --> 00:00:28.193
neXgen changes that.

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:37.172
Patients find you online, choose a time, and confirm their seat by paying a small ₹50 booking fee to the platform.

00:00:38.572 --> 00:00:41.780
Your consultation fee is never touched.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:46.468
Patients pay you at the clinic, exactly as they do today.

00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:47.619
No commission.

00:00:47.619 --> 00:00:49.346
No settlement delays.

00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:50.991
And joining is free.

00:00:52.391 --> 00:01:00.186
Every patient in your district who searches by speciality, symptom or locality sees your profile —

00:01:00.186 --> 00:01:06.709
your photo, experience, ratings, your chamber on the map, and your next free slot.

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:11.817
Because patients have paid to confirm, they show up.

00:01:11.817 --> 00:01:21.443
Reminders on WhatsApp and SMS bring them in on time, and free rescheduling means a busy patient moves the visit instead of skipping it.

00:01:22.843 --> 00:01:28.047
When someone cancels, the waitlist alerts the next patient instantly —

00:01:28.047 --> 00:01:31.838
so the seat is filled again instead of going empty.

00:01:33.238 --> 00:01:35.009
Your OPD runs on tokens.

00:01:35.009 --> 00:01:43.125
Every booking gets a token number in order, each slot has a limit you set, and your desk sees the live queue —

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:47.035
no crowd at the door, and more time for each patient.

00:01:48.435 --> 00:01:53.591
Turn on video consultations for follow-ups and patients from far away.

00:01:53.591 --> 00:01:57.716
See them from your clinic or from home, in the evening —

00:01:57.716 --> 00:01:59.926
without adding a single chair.

00:02:01.326 --> 00:02:06.131
Your digital prescription reaches the patient's health vault instantly.

00:02:06.131 --> 00:02:11.612
Their history is ready at the next visit, and they can book you again in one tap.

00:02:13.012 --> 00:02:15.968
After each visit, patients can rate you —

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.347
building trust with new patients.

00:02:18.347 --> 00:02:24.403
And if you are running late, your desk can inform every booked patient in one click.

00:02:25.803 --> 00:02:28.784
Practise at more than one chamber?

00:02:28.784 --> 00:02:32.554
Each gets its own address, map and timings.

00:02:32.554 --> 00:02:40.269
Your dashboard shows today's bookings, chamber load, follow-ups and ratings at a glance.

00:02:41.668 --> 00:02:54.441
A simple illustration: if your fee is ₹400 and neXgen brings you just four more patients a day, that is ₹1,600 more per day —

00:02:54.441 --> 00:02:58.426
about ₹41,600 a month over 26 OPD days.

00:02:58.426 --> 00:03:04.353
Your numbers will vary, but every extra fee is 100% yours.

00:03:05.753 --> 00:03:07.779
Joining takes three steps.

00:03:07.779 --> 00:03:13.312
Apply on our website with your registration number and chamber details.

00:03:13.312 --> 00:03:15.027
Our team verifies you.

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:19.002
Your profile goes live, and patients start booking.

00:03:20.402 --> 00:03:22.363
neXgen Healthcare.

00:03:22.363 --> 00:03:27.810
More patients, a calmer OPD, and 100% of your fee.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.553
Join free today.
